{
  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "suzhou-city",
    "name": {
      "zh": "苏州智慧城市（金鸡湖-姑苏示范）",
      "en": "Suzhou smart city (Jinji Lake – Gusu demonstration)"
    },
    "templateVersion": 2,
    "description": {
      "zh": "城市级地理地图（geo）示范环境：真实苏州地理的 9 个城区多边形（金鸡湖CBD、独墅湖高教区、苏州工业园区、姑苏老城、高新区工业园、苏州站交通枢纽、相城居民区、吴中城南、太湖新城），33 台市政级设备（聚光AQMS-1000国标站、先河网格化微站、海康/大华雷视车检器、海信信号机、威胜三相电表、顺舟单灯控制器、智慧灯杆、雷达水位计、海康球机、特来电直流充电桩、NB-IoT井盖传感器、应急广播音柱、国网负控终端），12 个跨部门利益方 Agent（7 政府/公共机构 + 5 市场主体，每个市场主体发布跨主体服务）。任何城市事件都必须跨政府↔市场协作（AC）才能闭环；本版在事件驱动之外内嵌确定性 Flow：用电高峰自动需求响应（负控终端+CBD 景观照明+充电桩限充三线联动）与突发车流自动绿波（车站枢纽与金鸡湖 CBD 信号机跨区联动），人流 zone 配 occupantSchedule，城市长周期事件推荐 30 倍速回放。（v2.2 刷新：全部 agent 配置 LLM，节点全部对齐引擎可执行命令面，内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）",
      "en": "City-scale geographic-map (geo) demo environment: 9 real-Suzhou district polygons (Jinji Lake CBD, Dushu Lake Higher-Ed District, Suzhou Industrial Park, Gusu Old Town, New District Industrial Park, Suzhou Station Transit Hub, Xiangcheng Residential District, Wuzhong South-City, Taihu New City), 33 municipal-grade devices, and 12 cross-department stakeholder agents (7 government / public bodies + 5 market entities, each publishing cross-entity services). Any urban event must cross the government↔market collaboration (AC) to close the loop; this revision additionally embeds deterministic flows — peak-load demand response (load-control terminal + CBD facade lighting + charging-pile curtailment) and traffic-surge green wave (station + CBD signal controllers across districts). High-footfall zones carry occupantSchedule; 30x playback recommended for the city-scale event cycle. (v2.2 refresh: all agents LLM-configured; node capabilities aligned to the engine command surface); 2 embedded deterministic flows)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "苏州城市压力测试：晚高峰、PM2.5、用电高峰、暴雨内涝连环登场，全靠政企 Agent 跨主体协作闭环",
      "en": "A stress-test day in Suzhou: rush hour, PM2.5, peak load and flash floods — closed only by government–market agent collaboration."
    },
    "heroEventId": "evt-accident",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 30,
    "vendorDisclaimer": {
      "zh": "场景中出现的厂商与品牌名称（聚光、先河、海康威视、大华、海信、威胜、顺舟、特来电、国网、滴滴、美团、哈啰、万达等）仅作 illustrative 演示用途，不代表任何商业背书、授权或合作关系。",
      "en": "Vendor and brand names appearing in this scenario (Juguang, Xianhe, Hikvision, Dahua, Hisense, Wasion, Sunrou, TELD, State Grid, DiDi, Meituan, Helo, Wanda, etc.) are used for illustrative demo purposes only and do not represent any commercial endorsement, authorization, or partnership."
    }
  },
